<div class="delivery-approach reveal">
  <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Delivery approach</p>
  <h3 class="section-title mb-12">A four-phase methodology</h3>
  <div class="process-grid">
    <div class="process-step"><span>01</span><h4>Assess</h4><p>Discover current state, map constraints, define success criteria with stakeholders.</p></div>
    <div class="process-step"><span>02</span><h4>Design</h4><p>Architect the target state — technology, process, governance, and vendor strategy aligned to outcomes.</p></div>
    <div class="process-step"><span>03</span><h4>Recommend</h4><p>Present options ranked by fit, cost, and risk — not a single preferred answer. Each option includes the trade-offs and dependencies.</p></div>
    <div class="process-step"><span>04</span><h4>Plan</h4><p>For the selected direction, build the implementation plan — work breakdown, vendor shortlist, timeline, and governance structure.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>